{"nodes":[{"id":"hdr","type":"text","x":0,"y":-700,"width":1900,"height":320,"text":"# B｜身份阶级与社会位置\n## R4.1 视觉运行总览\n\n这张 Canvas 用于导航与运行判断；详细 96 节点见右侧文件。\n\n**纪律：题材名不继承十元，主辅只是候选，动态链逐阶段重判。**","color":"4"},{"id":"detail","type":"file","x":2100,"y":-700,"width":900,"height":320,"file":"013_AI用素材库/06B_韩漫题材对象行为库_十元分析版/28_64题材完全节点化重构/R4_B_身份阶级与社会位置.canvas"},{"id":"text","type":"file","x":3200,"y":-700,"width":900,"height":320,"file":"013_AI用素材库/06B_韩漫题材对象行为库_十元分析版/28_64题材完全节点化重构/B_身份阶级与社会位置_节点化.md"},{"id":"warn","type":"text","x":4300,"y":-700,"width":1700,"height":320,"text":"## 状态说明\n- `scaffold-index`\n- `completion: partial`\n- `theory_authority: non-canonical`\n\n已锁定关系只是可调用候选，仍需案例证明机制、变量、阶段和第三因素。","color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"## 0 入口\n初始主辅候选\n结论等级","color":"4"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","x":500,"y":0,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"## 1 对象\n主对象\n关联对象分开","color":"3"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","x":1000,"y":0,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"## 2 主体\n稳定本体\n阶段状态\n关系功能","color":"3"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","x":1500,"y":0,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"## 3 关系\n权限分配\n承载与认可分账","color":"3"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","x":2000,"y":0,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"## 4 触发\n行动者→对象\n目的/回应/代价","color":"3"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","x":2500,"y":0,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"## 5 状态\n前态→后态\n不可逆变量","color":"2"},{"id":"s6","type":"text","x":3000,"y":0,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"## 6 端点\n源/目标\n主辅/体量/顺序","color":"2"},{"id":"s7","type":"text","x":3500,"y":0,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"## 7 生克补\n状态+机制\n变量+第三因素","color":"5"},{"id":"s8","type":"text","x":4000,"y":0,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"## 8 动态链\n接管条件\n分支/结算/锚点","color":"5"},{"id":"s9","type":"text","x":4500,"y":0,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"## 9 主题\n中心问题\n转折/高潮/结局","color":"6"},{"id":"s10","type":"text","x":5000,"y":0,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"## 10 反证\n拿掉/反向\n最近邻/替代","color":"6"},{"id":"s11","type":"text","x":5500,"y":0,"width":460,"height":230,"text":"## 11 输出\n卡片化输出\n缺项标 incomplete","color":"6"},{"id":"tB01","type":"text","x":0,"y":650,"width":1350,"height":420,"text":"# T-B01｜财阀继承\n**候选主 x｜scaffold**\n\n主对象：表决权与实际控制\n链：资格壳争议 → x接管 → x生x并z\n反证：有钱/持股≠实际掌握\n\n→ 进入详细12节点回填","color":"5"},{"id":"tB02","type":"text","x":1530,"y":650,"width":1350,"height":420,"text":"# T-B02｜真假继承人\n**候选主 x并z｜scaffold**\n\n主对象：识别与准入身份壳\n链：旧壳 → 证据控制x / 确认z分账 → 新壳\n警告：真实与被采用必须分开\n\n→ 进入详细12节点回填","color":"5"},{"id":"tB03","type":"text","x":3060,"y":650,"width":1350,"height":420,"text":"# T-B03｜豪门复仇\n**候选主 x｜scaffold**\n\n主对象：被夺控制边界\n链：x丧失 → xn组织 → zx可接管 → x/z分账结算\n反证：泄愤打脸≠zx\n\n→ 进入详细12节点回填","color":"5"},{"id":"tB04","type":"text","x":4590,"y":650,"width":1350,"height":420,"text":"# T-B04｜娱乐圈上位\n**候选主 z｜scaffold**\n\n主对象：被具体主体确认的作品/能力\n链：x并z界面 → z确认；x门控可克z\n警告：流量、热搜≠z\n\n→ 进入详细12节点回填","color":"4"},{"id":"tB05","type":"text","x":0,"y":1250,"width":1350,"height":420,"text":"# T-B05｜商战创业\n**候选主 xn｜scaffold**\n\n主对象：主动组织的持续结构\n链：零散 → xn → x/n/zx分支\n警告：n生xn不得默认；转H区复核\n\n→ 进入详细12节点回填","color":"4"},{"id":"tB06","type":"text","x":1530,"y":1250,"width":1350,"height":420,"text":"# T-B06｜贵族社交\n**候选主 x并z｜scaffold**\n\n主对象：礼法身份壳与社交准入\n链：礼法壳 → z确认 → x撕裂/重建\n反证：华服舞会≠x并z\n\n→ 进入详细12节点回填","color":"5"},{"id":"tB07","type":"text","x":3060,"y":1250,"width":1350,"height":420,"text":"# T-B07｜宫廷继承\n**候选主 x｜scaffold**\n\n主对象：军权/任免/处置边界\n链：名位争议 → xn组织 → x/zx争夺 → 新名位壳\n反证：称帝≠实际掌握\n\n→ 进入详细12节点回填","color":"5"},{"id":"tB08","type":"text","x":4590,"y":1250,"width":1350,"height":420,"text":"# T-B08｜底层改造／逆袭\n**候选主 z｜scaffold**\n\n主对象：被确认的能力/身份/选择\n链：旧评价 → x并z证据壳 → z分账\n警告：zx生zn未锁定；转D区复核\n\n→ 进入详细12节点回填","color":"4"},{"id":"crossH","type":"text","x":0,"y":1950,"width":1850,"height":280,"text":"## H区复核｜职业现实与行业\nB04 娱乐圈：职业生产、平台经营\nB05 创业：商业经营、行业流程\n\nB区只保留社会位置、准入、控制边界与认可。","color":"1"},{"id":"crossD","type":"text","x":2050,"y":1950,"width":1850,"height":280,"text":"## D区复核｜能力成长战斗竞争\nB08 逆袭：能力升级、胜负、排名\n\nB区只保留旧评价、可识别证据、认可分账与社会位置变化。","color":"1"},{"id":"lock","type":"text","x":4100,"y":1950,"width":1900,"height":280,"text":"## 关系状态警示\n✅ 可候选：x并z生z、x生x并z、x克z、xn克zx\n⚠ 条件调用：n生xn、xn补z/z补xn\n⛔ 未锁定：zx生zn，不得写成正式结论","color":"2"}],"edges":[{"id":"es0_1","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left"},{"id":"es1_2","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left"},{"id":"es2_3","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left"},{"id":"es3_4","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left"},{"id":"es4_5","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left"},{"id":"es5_6","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s6","toSide":"left"},{"id":"es6_7","fromNode":"s6","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s7","toSide":"left"},{"id":"es7_8","fromNode":"s7","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s8","toSide":"left"},{"id":"es8_9","fromNode":"s8","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s9","toSide":"left"},{"id":"es9_10","fromNode":"s9","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s10","toSide":"left"},{"id":"es10_11","fromNode":"s10","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s11","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_s8_B01","fromNode":"s8","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"tB01","toSide":"top","label":"题材运行"},{"id":"e_s8_B02","fromNode":"s8","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"tB02","toSide":"top","label":"题材运行"},{"id":"e_s8_B03","fromNode":"s8","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"tB03","toSide":"top","label":"题材运行"},{"id":"e_s8_B04","fromNode":"s8","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"tB04","toSide":"top","label":"题材运行"},{"id":"e_s8_B05","fromNode":"s8","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"tB05","toSide":"top","label":"题材运行"},{"id":"e_s8_B06","fromNode":"s8","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"tB06","toSide":"top","label":"题材运行"},{"id":"e_s8_B07","fromNode":"s8","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"tB07","toSide":"top","label":"题材运行"},{"id":"e_s8_B08","fromNode":"s8","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"tB08","toSide":"top","label":"题材运行"},{"id":"e_B04_H","fromNode":"tB04","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"crossH","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_B05_H","fromNode":"tB05","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"crossH","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_B08_D","fromNode":"tB08","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"crossD","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_B08_lock","fromNode":"tB08","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"lock","toSide":"top","label":"关系状态"}]}